  <div style="margin-top: 50px;">
    <h2 class="section-title">PURPOSE AND SCOPE</h2>
    <p>This document was prepared by the <span data-field="organization.name">{{ organization.name }}</span> Department of Environmental and Occupational Health and Safety. The document is intended for the exclusive use of the University in dealing with infectious waste management on the campus of <span data-field="university.name">{{ university.name }}</span>. No part of this document may be reproduced on any form or by any electronic or mechanical means including information storage and retrieval systems without permission in writing from <span data-field="university.name">{{ university.name }}</span>.</p>
